                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2024-21319**\n| Severity | Package | Fixed Version | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|MEDIUM|System.IdentityModel.Tokens.Jwt|5.7.0, 6.34.0, 7.1.2|[CVE-2024-21319](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2024-21319)|\n\nMicrosoft Identity Denial of service vulnerability"
